---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Privacy and Personal Data Protection" description="Privacy information for the MNEMORİSK research project website and contact form.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="page-intro">
      <div class="eyebrow">PRIVACY / DATA PROTECTION</div>
      <h1>Privacy and personal data protection</h1>
      <p>Information about current data processing activities and communication channels on the MNEMORİSK website.</p>
    </section>
    <article class="privacy-content">
      <section>
        <h2>Project, administration and data controller</h2>
        <p>MNEMORİSK is a research project carried out at Erzincan Binali Yıldırım University and awarded support under the TÜBİTAK 1001 Programme (project no. 226K193). The website's technical and editorial administration is managed by Associate Professor Akın Bakioğlu.</p>
        <p>The identity of the data controller for specific website and project processing activities is being clarified with reference to the purposes and means of processing and the University's role. Website administration alone is not presented here as a definitive legal determination of the controller. For privacy questions or to identify the appropriate request channel, contact <a href="mailto:mnemorisk@gmail.com">mnemorisk@gmail.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Data processed through the contact form</h2>
        <p>When you submit the contact form, your name, email address, selected subject and message are processed to receive, evaluate and respond to your enquiry. Service providers may also process technical connection information needed to deliver the form or prevent abuse.</p>
        <p>The legal basis being assessed for this activity is legitimate interests under Article 5(2)(f) of Türkiye's Personal Data Protection Law No. 6698 (KVKK). Its suitability and the required balancing assessment must be confirmed together with the data-controller determination. This notice does not itself constitute collection of explicit consent.</p>
        <p>You may instead email <a href="mailto:mnemorisk@gmail.com">mnemorisk@gmail.com</a> directly. Do not send sensitive personal data, confidential research participant information or identity documents through the form.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>FormSubmit, international processing and retention</h2>
        <p>Contact form submissions are delivered to the project email address through <a href="https://formsubmit.co/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FormSubmit</a>. The form fields and technical connection details are transmitted to that provider. Processing or transfer abroad may occur through its infrastructure; compliance with Article 9 of the KVKK requires separate assessment.</p>
        <p>FormSubmit's published documentation states that it retains submissions in its service for 30 days. The intended retention policy for correspondence received in the project's mailbox is up to one year after the enquiry is concluded. Automated deletion from mailboxes or backups is not claimed until the necessary procedures are implemented. Legal retention duties or disputes may require longer preservation in specific cases.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Cookies and visitor analytics</h2>
        <p>No first-party advertising or analytics cookies or persistent visitor identifiers are currently enabled on MNEMORİSK pages. A dedicated visitor analytics system is being developed but <strong>is not yet active</strong>. Before activation, this page will explain the collected categories, legal basis, retention period and any required consent mechanism.</p>
        <p>External verification steps associated with the contact form and operational or security processes of providers such as GitHub Pages and Cloudflare may involve technical data processing. We therefore do not claim that every third-party service uses no cookies or connection logs.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Your rights and how to apply</h2>
        <p>Under Article 11 of Law No. 6698, you may ask whether your personal data is processed, request information about such processing and, where the applicable conditions are met, request correction or erasure. Under Article 13, duly submitted applications must be answered as soon as possible and no later than 30 days, generally without charge.</p>
        <p>Formal applications may be made in writing or through methods recognised by the applicable rules, including registered electronic mail (KEP), qualified electronic signatures, mobile signatures or an email address previously supplied and registered with the controller. Applications should contain the required identification, contact and request information. <strong>Do not submit your national ID number or ID documents through the ordinary website contact form.</strong> To establish the appropriate application channel, first contact <a href="mailto:mnemorisk@gmail.com">mnemorisk@gmail.com</a>.</p>
        <p>See the <a href="https://www.kvkk.gov.tr/Icerik/2062/Basvuru-Hakki" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Turkish Personal Data Protection Authority's guidance on applications</a>.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>External links and updates</h2>
        <p>This site is published using GitHub Pages and its domain is managed through Cloudflare. External links may lead to services with their own privacy terms. Changes to this information and the date of the latest update will be published on this page.</p>
      </section>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: 25 November 2026</p>
    </article>
  </div>
  <style>
    .privacy-content{max-width:890px;padding:28px 0 78px}
    .privacy-content section{padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dce5eb}
    .privacy-content section:first-child{padding-top:5px}
    .privacy-content h2{font-size:clamp(20px,2.2vw,25px);line-height:1.3;color:#173c55;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 12px}
    .privacy-content p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.85;color:#4b6173;margin:0 0 13px}
    .privacy-content a{color:#15577c;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
    .updated{color:#788b9a!important;font-size:12px!important;margin-top:25px!important}
    @media(max-width:600px){.privacy-content{padding:18px 0 55px}.privacy-content section{padding:20px 0}.privacy-content p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.75}}
  </style>
</SiteLayout>